  "title": "Agent States: Reason Codes for Lunch, Meetings and Training | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "When agents are not taking work, a manager needs to know why. In the CrestApps Contact Center, a reason code such as Lunch, Team meeting or Training gives the agent a name to pick, and every report and the Live dashboard shows both the state and the reason.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why agent states, and how reason codes map to presence states\n• Creating a reason code: name, state, sort order\n• What agents see in the presence menu\n• Retiring a reason code without losing history\n• Break requests, fallbacks and use cases",
